<title>USA: Crossmann Communities sets shr dividend.</title>
<headline>Crossmann Communities sets shr dividend.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Crossmann Communities Inc said Friday it declared a share dividend of 0.5 common shares, no par value, on each issued and outstanding common share.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable on August 25, to sahreholders of record August 18.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
